Mere Sapno Ki Rani Guitar Chords with a strumming pattern from the old Hindi movie Aradhana sung by Kishore Kumar.

FACT: Originally, Mohammed Rafi was supposed to have sung all the songs in the film, but the composer, Sachin Dev Burman fell ill. His son, R.D. Burman reportedly ghost-composed this song, and took a chance and gave the song to Kishore Kumar.

